# Self-update signing keys: private keys + the release counter are NEVER
# committed; the public SPKI/keyid files ARE (they're baked into the NRO
# keyring and are public trust anchors).
keys/*.key.pem
keys/.release-counter
romfs/main.js
romfs/main.js.map
icon.jpg
*.log
.DS_Store
# Vendored @switch-web/runtime dist — populated from sibling brewser-runtime/
# checkout by `node scripts/sync-runtime.mjs` (also wired as a postinstall
# hook). Excluded so per-runtime-change diffs stay lean. Consumers without
# the sibling checkout get a warning from postinstall and must populate
# runtime/ manually before `npm run build`.
runtime/
